ts/markdown.md:53:- `/create:skill`\n.skilled/agents/markdown.md:196:| `/create:skill`         | New skill `SKILL.md` or doc-only skill resource         | `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-md-template.md` and, when needed, `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-reference-template.md` |\n.skilled/agents/markdown.md:301:| `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-md-template.md`                           | Skill creation template for `/create:skill`                     |\n.claude/agents/markdown.md:39:- `/create:skill`\n.claude/agents/markdown.md:182:| `/create:skill`         | New skill `SKILL.md` or doc-only skill resource         | `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-md-template.md` and, when needed, `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-reference-template.md` |\n.claude/agents/markdown.md:287:| `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-md-template.md`                           | Skill creation template for `/create:skill`                     |\nREADME.md:1208:**`/create:skill`** - unified skill creation and update workflow\nREADME.md:1693:Use `/create:skill` to scaffold the skill structure. The command creates the `SKILL.md`, references and assets directories following the `sk-doc` template. Discovery reads its `SKILL.md` frontmatter and `graph-metadata.json`, so no registration step follows. Adding a row to `.skilled/skills/README.txt` keeps the catalog complete for human readers.\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":".codex/SYNC.md:40:<!-- Generated by sync-prompts.cjs from .skilled/commands/create/skill.md — do not edit by hand. -->\nCONTRIBUTING.md:198:| **Medium** | New skills | Scaffold with `/create:skill`, or `/create:skill-parent` for a skill with nested modes |\n.skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/assets/checklists/command-authoring.md:35:- [ ] Read a YAML-router command such as `.skilled/commands/create/skill.md` or `.skilled/commands/speckit/complete.md`.\n.skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/assets/checklists/command-authoring.md:66:- [ ] grep verification for command frontmatter: `rg -n \"^(description|argument-hint|allowed-tools):\" .skilled/commands/create/skill.md .skilled/commands/speckit/complete.md .skilled/commands/deep/research.md`.\n.skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/assets/checklists/command-authoring.md:67:- [ ] grep verification for YAML-router assets: `rg -n \"create_skill_(auto|confirm)\\\\.yaml|speckit_complete_(auto|confirm)\\\\.yaml|presentation\" .skilled/commands/create/skill.md .skilled/commands/speckit/complete.md`.\n.skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/assets/checklists/command-authoring.md:75:- YAML-router examples: `.skilled/commands/create/skill.md`, `.skilled/commands/speckit/complete.md`\n.skilled/agents/markdown.md:53:- `/create:skill`\n.skilled/agents/markdown.md:196:| `/create:skill`         | New skill `SKILL.md` or doc-only skill resource         | `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-md-template.md` and, when needed, `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-reference-template.md` |\n.skilled/agents/markdown.md:301:| `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-md-template.md`                           | Skill creation template for `/create:skill`                     |\n.claude/agents/markdown.md:39:- `/create:skill`\n.claude/agents/markdown.md:182:| `/create:skill`         | New skill `SKILL.md` or doc-only skill resource         | `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-md-template.md` and, when needed, `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-reference-template.md` |\n.claude/agents/markdown.md:287:| `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill/assets/skill/skill-md-template.md`                           | Skill creation template for `/create:skill`                     |\nREADME.md:1208:**`/create:skill`** - unified skill creation and update workflow\nREADME.md:1693:Use `/create:skill` to scaffold the skill structure. The command creates the `SKILL.md`, references and assets directories following the `sk-doc` template. Discovery reads its `SKILL.md` frontmatter and `graph-metadata.json`, so no registration step follows. Adding a row to `.skilled/skills/README.txt` keeps the catalog complete for human readers.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"rg -n -P '/create:skill(?![-\\\\w])|(?<![-\\\\w/])create:skill(?![-\\\\w])|create/skill\\\\.md|command-create-skill(?![-\\\\w])' README.md CONTRIBUTING.md .skilled/agents/markdown.md .claude/agents/markdown.md .skilled/skills/sk-code/sk-code-skilled/assets/checklists/command-authoring.md .codex/SYNC.md\", \"workdir\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794582782103,"end":1794582784446}}}}
