{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794582869211,"sessionID":"ses_e2a8827d1ffeTImD0J7JngRHUY","part":{"partID":"prt_1d57971060015gsVHP52EgyqoK","sessionID":"ses_e2a8827d1ffeTImD0J7JngRHUY","messageID":"msg_1d579582d001dcBn8NHiO1E6hx","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a4d396296921bc56","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/CONTRIBUTING.md","oldString":"| **Medium** | New skills | Scaffold with `/create:skill`, or `/create:skill-parent` for a skill with nested modes |","newString":"| **Medium** | New skills | Scaffold with `/create:sk-skill`, or `/create:skill-parent` for a skill with nested modes |"},"output":"Edited CONTRIBUTING.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"CONTRIBUTING.md","patch":"Index: CONTRIBUTING.md\n===================================================================\n--- CONTRIBUTING.md\n+++ CONTRIBUTING.md\n@@ -194,9 +194,9 @@\n |----------|------|-------------|\n | **High** | Bug fixes | With clear reproduction steps |\n | **High** | Performance | Improvements with benchmarks |\n | **High** | Documentation | Improvements and clarifications |\n-| **Medium** | New skills | Scaffold with `/create:skill`, or `/create:skill-parent` for a skill with nested modes |\n+| **Medium** | New skills | Scaffold with `/create:sk-skill`, or `/create:skill-parent` for a skill with nested modes |\n | **Medium** | Commands and agents | Scaffold with `/create:command` and `/create:agent` |\n | **Medium** | Tests | Test coverage |\n | **Always** | Typo fixes | Quick corrections welcome |\n | **Always** | Code clarity | Readability improvements |\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited CONTRIBUTING.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/CONTRIBUTING.md\", \"oldString\": \"| **Medium** | New skills | Scaffold with `/create:skill`, or `/create:skill-parent` for a skill with nested modes |\", \"newString\": \"| **Medium** | New skills | Scaffold with `/create:sk-skill`, or `/create:skill-parent` for a skill with nested modes |\"}"},"time":{"start":1794582868230,"end":1794582869211}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794582869217,"sessionID":"ses_e2a8827d1ffeTImD0J7JngRHUY","part":{"partID":"prt_1d5796bc5001vvU40Zymxtlig5","sessionID":"ses_e2a8827d1ffeTImD0J7JngRHUY","messageID":"msg_1d579582d001dcBn8NHiO1E6hx","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a6de84eff9dd4338","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/README.md","oldString":"**`/create:skill`** - unified skill creation and update workflow","newString":"**`/create:sk-skill`** - unified skill creation and update workflow"},"output":"Edited README.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"README.md","patch":"Index: README.md\n===================================================================\n--- README.md\n+++ README.md\n@@ -1204,9 +1204,9 @@\n &nbsp;\n \n #### CREATE\n \n-**`/create:skill`** - unified skill creation and update workflow\n+**`/create:sk-skill`** - unified skill creation and update workflow\n \n Creates `SKILL.md` with 8-section structure, `README.md`, references and assets directories. It registers nothing: discovery reads `graph-metadata.json`, and the advisor refresh stays with the operator. Modes: `:auto`, `:confirm`.\n \n **`/create:skill-parent`** - parent skill with nested modes\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited README.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/README.md\", \"oldString\": \"**`/create:skill`** - unified skill creation and update workflow\", \"newString\": \"**`/create:sk-skill`** - unified skill creation and update workflow\"}"},"time":{"start":1794582866885,"end":1794582869217}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794582869224,"sessionID":"ses_e2a8827d1ffeTImD0J7JngRHUY","part":{"partID":"prt_1d5796e640010Ep9KX0XvWMTbJ","sessionID":"ses_e2a8827d1ffeTImD0J7JngRHUY","messageID":"msg_1d579582d001dcBn8NHiO1E6hx","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8766f24e335b7757","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/README.md","oldString":"Use `/create:skill` to scaffold the skill structure.","newString":"Use `/create:sk-skill` to scaffold the skill structure."},"output":"Edited README.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"README.md","patch":"Index: README.md\n===================================================================\n--- README.md\n+++ README.md\n@@ -1689,9 +1689,9 @@\n &nbsp;\n \n **Q: How can I add a new skill to the framework?**\n \n-Use `/create:skill` to scaffold the skill structure. The command creates the `SKILL.md`, references and assets directories following the `sk-doc` template. Discovery reads its `SKILL.md` frontmatter and `graph-metadata.json`, so no registration step follows. Adding a row to `.skilled/skills/README.txt` keeps the catalog complete for human readers.\n+Use `/create:sk-skill` to scaffold the skill structure. The command creates the `SKILL.md`, references and assets directories following the `sk-doc` template. Discovery reads its `SKILL.md` frontmatter and `graph-metadata.json`, so no registration step follows. Adding a row to `.skilled/skills/README.txt` keeps the catalog complete for human readers.\n \n &nbsp;\n \n **Q: What does \"local-first\" mean for continuity?**\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited README.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/README.md\", \"oldString\": \"Use `/create:skill` to scaffold the skill structure.\", \"newString\": \"Use `/create:sk-skill` to scaffold the skill structure.\"}"},"time":{"start":1794582867556,"end":1794582869224}}}}
