/agents/design.md resolves to the canonical file\nNOT COMPARED  design [dsh] .dsh/agents/design.patch.yml (format-not-comparable)\nSAME FILE  markdown [opencode] .opencode/agents/markdown.md resolves to the canonical file\nNOT COMPARED  markdown [dsh] .dsh/agents/markdown.patch.yml (format-not-comparable)\nDRIFT  markdown [codex] missing=[\"sk-skill\"] unexpected=[]\nDRIFT  markdown [pi] missing=[\"sk-skill\"] unexpected=[]\nSAME FILE  orchestrate [opencode] .opencode/agents/orchestrate.md resolves to the canonical file\nNOT COMPARED  orchestrate [dsh] .dsh/agents/orchestrate.patch.yml (format-not-comparable)\nSAME FILE  prompt-improver [opencode] .opencode/agents/prompt-improver.md resolves to the canonical file\nNOT COMPARED  prompt-improver [dsh] .dsh/agents/prompt-improver.patch.yml (format-not-comparable)\nSAME FILE  review [opencode] .opencode/agents/review.md resolves to the canonical file\nNOT COMPARED  review [dsh] .dsh/agents/review.patch.yml (format-not-comparable)\n\nBLOCKED: 1 agent(s) have out-of-sync runtime mirrors: markdown\nFix: re-sync the .opencode / .claude copies so each agent body matches.\nAMSC exit: 1\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"node .skilled/bin/check-agent-mirror-sync.cjs; echo \\\"AMSC exit: $?\\\"\", \"workdir\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794582891439,"end":1794582891907}}}}
